WEBVTT

00:10:27.942 --> 00:10:31.295
Zato vas molim da budete uz nas

00:10:31.295 --> 00:10:35.110
dok stvaramo budućnost bez nasilja

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:39.530
za žene i devojčice
i muškarce i dečake širom sveta.

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:41.692
Mnogo vam hvala.

00:10:41.692 --> 00:10:47.803
(Aplauz)